# AC-017/AC-018 — NOT_YET_AVAILABLE Fast-Fail (BC-2.10.017)
# Demonstrates: guard fires BEFORE audit await; -32003 within 1s with slow AuditWriter.

Output docs/demo-evidence/S-DEMO-PRISMQL-GRAMMAR-REMEDIATION-001/AC-017-018-not-yet-available.gif
Output docs/demo-evidence/S-DEMO-PRISMQL-GRAMMAR-REMEDIATION-001/AC-017-018-not-yet-available.webm

Require cargo

Set Shell "zsh"
